@startuml organization-enterprise-boundary
title Organization / Enterprise Boundary ; per ADR-ES-022 section 5

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Enterprise" as E
class "Organization" as Org

E --> Org : comprises
Org -[dotted]- E : is NOT
E -[dotted]- Org : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-022 section 5:
  Enterprise comprises Organizations. An Organization is part of
  an Enterprise, but an Organization is NOT an Enterprise.
end note

@enduml
